OL,3,GNEWSAFather and son sentenced for drug
OL,4,Adealing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father who recruited his son to help
OL,7,Fhim sell drugs has been jailed.
OL,9,FDavid McNeill, 38 and from Gateshead,
OL,10,Fsold drugs including cocaine, cannabis
OL,11,Fand codeine over an 18-month period,
OL,12,FNewcastle Crown Court heard.
OL,14,FJudge Graham Robinson said McNeill, who
OL,15,Fwas jailed for three years and four
OL,16,Fmonths, played a "significant role"
OL,17,Fsupplying drugs to street dealers, and
OL,18,F"involved" his son James, 22, in the
OL,19,Foperation.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
