OL,3,GNEWSAFather and son sentenced for drug
OL,4,Adealing
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth admitted conspiracy to supply
OL,7,FClass A, B and C drugs, with James
OL,8,FMcNeill, who unlike his father had no
OL,9,Fprevious convictions, being jailed for
OL,10,Ftwo and half years, suspended for two
OL,11,Fyears.
